cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BrainSeg: Deep Learning-based Brain MRI Segmentation and Annotation"
authors:
  - family-names: Mandol
    given-names: Md Rasel
repository-code: https://github.com/raselmandol/brainseg
license: MIT
version: 1.5.5
date-released: 2026-01-03
abstract: >
  BrainSeg is an open-source deep learning-based framework for brain MRI 
  segmentation, focusing on lightweight architectures, medical image
  analysis, and deployment on resource-constrained devices. Using
  BrainSeg-AI, users can perform annotation of medical images to
  support dataset creation and validation workflows.
